@token = COLARAQUI

### Criar artista - Pink Floyd

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Pink Floyd",
    "country": "Reino Unido",
    "bio": "Banda britânica de rock progressivo."
}

### Criar artista - Metallica

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Metallica",
    "country": "Estados Unidos",
    "bio": "Banda norte-americana de heavy metal."
}

### Listar artistas

GET http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar artista

GET http://localhost:3000/api/artists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Artista inexistente

GET http://localhost:3000/api/artists/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar artista

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/artists/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "bio": "Banda britânica formada em Londres, conhecida pelo rock progressivo."
}

### Artista inválido

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "P",
    "country": "R",
    "bio": "x"
}

### Artistas sem token

GET http://localhost:3000/api/artists

### Criar artista temporário

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Artista Teste",
    "country": "Brasil",
    "bio": "Registro temporário para testar exclusão."
}

### Excluir artista temporário

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/artists/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}